out 1
out 2
only the errors:
error: [1, 2] 0.3
both:
out 1
error: [1, 2] 0.3
out 2
count.ce:2:5: text.Decimals needs a count of decimals from 0 to 20, not the number 2.5.
  2 | text.Decimals(2.5, 1)
    |     ^
number.ce:2:5: text.Decimals needs numbers, not the text "1".
  2 | text.Decimals(2, "1")
    |     ^
exit 1
